      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure, here is a draft of the performance review for Leo:\n\n---\n\nLeo has been an integral part of our engineering team over the past year, contributing significantly to several key projects. However, over the last month, there have been notable challenges regarding his sprint performance. Leo missed three major sprint deadlines, which has impacted the team's overall progress and caused delays in deliverables.\n\nThe quality of his recent code submissions has also shown a noticeable decline. Unlike his previous high standards, we're observing a higher frequency of bugs in his pull requests. This decrease in code quality concerns the team, as it affects both the product stability and our timelines.\n\nDuring standups, Leo has been less engaged and team-oriented, which we've noticed as a decrease in his active participation and collaboration. It's crucial for our team's success that every member fully engages and contributes to discussions and problem-solving.\n\nWhile Leo is a skilled engineer with a strong technical background, recent patterns suggest the need for some additional support to address these performance issues. I encourage Leo to put in the extra effort to meet deadlines, improve code quality, and engage more actively in team activities.\n\nI believe that with our tailored support and coaching, Leo can realign to our high standards and continue to be a valuable member of our",
